+ * ran on Claude Opus 5.5 at high effort for 19 minutes, ending 12 minutes
+ * before launch: it read the plan, handed two scoped searches to read-only
+ * workers (Claude Sonnet 5.5 at medium, GPT-6.1 Sol at low), wrote the
+ * migration and the invite route, ran the members tests, opened #214 with
+ * its checks passing, and brought the plan's change map and contracts up to
+ * date with `edit_plan`, which is the save the plan's "Updated by" line
+ * names. Every model id is one 0.11.0 itself names (its tests, its default,
+ * its scripted worker); the catalog's names are AI Gateway's.
