+/**
+ * coding-agents-shot.ts -- "Coding agents work alongside you": the side panel close up, its strip of agent tabs with their generated titles, over the agent's transcript opened onto its work, where it updated the plan.
+ *
+ * Throwaway (`shot-spec.ts`). A close-up of the panel alone, captured at
+ * `LUKE_SHOT_ZOOM=2`. The sidebar stays open and the panel is staged 704
+ * points wide, so it starts at x 896 and a crop of x 892..1592 takes it
+ * whole short of the window's corner. The panel is on the finished agent,
+ * "Add teammate invitations", beside "Invite emails" at work. Once its
+ * transcript lands the staging opens the finished turn's folded work, as a
+ * developer would, so "Updated the plan: 3 added" stands under the strip.
+ */
